ZLEqualizer for WebCLAP (ports/zl-equalizer), all under ZL_WEBCLAP:

- PluginProcessor.cpp: ZL_WEBCLAP_HEADLESS builds the processor without its editor (module.wasm)
- controller.hpp, PluginEditor.hpp: ZLWebclapAccess (ports/zl-equalizer/zl_equalizer_access.h) as a friend, for
  the meters and controls that cross over as frames and which analyzers the editor shows
- lufs_matcher.hpp: setDiff, for the stand-in's matcher
- curve_panel.cpp, response_panel.cpp: no threads, so the two worker loops run one pass per repaint
  (paintOverChildren) on the editor's thread instead of waiting for notify()
- compact_combobox: the kit's JUCE names the display areas userArea/totalArea and has no popup item tooltips
  (ZL's JUCE fork adds them)
- main_panel, top_panel: no preset browser (panel/preset_browser/ left out of the build) and no preset button,
  the top bar closes the gap
- match_control_panel: no match preset files, so no save button and no "Preset" target
- ui_setting_panel: no Colour and no Credit tab (colour_setting_panel.cpp, credit_panel.cpp left out of the
  build), it opens on Control; a legal notice line (product, copyright, AGPL-3.0, sources) above the footer
- other_ui_setting_panel, ui_state.cpp, PluginEditor.cpp: no tooltip language setting, tooltips in English whatever
  was saved
- PluginEditor.cpp: not resizable, no resize corner (the page shows the editor at its size)
- ui_setting_panel.cpp: no folder button in the settings footer (there is no settings file to reveal)

